    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29763" root="عفل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَفَالِ</span></b> , [indeed.] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>, an expression of
reproach, (O, K,) addressed to a woman: K:)
one says to a female slave, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَا عَفَال</span> [as though
meaning <i>O thou that hast what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَفَلٌ</span> or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَفَلَةٌ</span>]. (O.)

